WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:01.620
Forty fields.

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:02.960
Twenty minutes.

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:04.380
Perfectly mapped.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.080
Import failed.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:08.730
Everything’s gone.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.730
People don’t quit at the hard part.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:16.110
They quit when their work disappears.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.110
And no, a sparklier retry button won’t save it.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:27.660
UX Ergonomics rides the real route, right through the stop where it breaks.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.650
The fix: keep the mappings.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.630
Say what retry will do.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:36.790
Give a way out.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:43.300
Then test it with only a keyboard: Tab, Tab, Enter.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:45.030
Nothing typed twice.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.290
Is it better?

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:50.790
Ask real people.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.150
Until then, it won’t say so.

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:02.480
UX Ergonomics.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.480
Make the next step easier to understand and do.
